        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Zhan Lie cries out against the plan to pawn it, calling Small Tornado Gu Bai Feng’s core Gu. Bai Feng answers with a bitter smile. After Bai Lian adds Lotus Cloth Gu and other Bai clansmen volunteer further Gu and gear, Bai Feng affirms their spirit of sacrificing for the clan.",
